('2507','2','1','for sale','Residential','0','general brokerage','with-swimming-pool-house-and-lot-in-greenwoods-pasig','With Swimming Pool House and Lot in Greenwoods Pasig','["Pre Owned"]','<p>Greenwoods Executive Village is a harmonious and well-maintained community with picnic grounds, basketball court, tennis court, and a multi-purpose clubhouse among others. The village is also home to numerous exquisite restaurants, offering you wonderful dining experiences within reach.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>One of the many conveniences Greenwoods provides is that it&rsquo;s easily accessible to Cainta, Taytay, and various parts of Metro Manila including Bonifacio Global City and the further south. And one small step outside each house here is an instant portal to malls such as SM Megamall and Shangri-La Plaza, as well as access to hospitals like The Medical City and other urban needs such as banks and offices.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Property Details</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>329 sqm Lot Area</p><p>?300 sqm Floor Area</p><p>3 Bedrooms</p><p>4 Toilets &amp; Baths</p><p>2 Garages</p><p>Upgraded Kitchen</p><p>Attic with Comfort Room and 2 Convertible Bedrooms</p><p>Swimming Pool with Hanging Garden</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Price starts at: P18,500,000.00</strong></p><p><strong>Property Description</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A house that&rsquo;s a heartbeat away from the city!&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Located in the sought-after Greenwoods Executive Village in Pasig City, this property offers a calming and convenient living experience for you and your family.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The interior of this property offers a spacious living room that creates a meditative atmosphere to enjoy your hobbies and to welcome your distinguished guests. The second floor&nbsp;ensures privacy for everyone in the family with its 3 well-appointed and peaceful bedrooms, each with its own toilet and bath.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Another interior highlight is that it boasts of a lovely upgraded kitchen with a space to put high-end appliances, perfect for those who are cooks and chefs at heart.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Need further privacy or another convertible room? This house offers an attic that can be converted into 2 bedrooms and a comfort room, making it a versatile space that can be customized according to your family&rsquo;s needs. Youll also appreciate the 2 garages, providing ample parking spaces for your vehicles.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Moving forward, the exterior highlights of this lovely house is the swimming pool, paired with a miniature garden that gives a serene and peaceful environment for your family and guests of honor.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The property is also equipped with a balcony at the front overlooking the whole street, and a terrace at the back where you can build a hanging garden, host special gatherings, and take photos of the sunrise and sunset (or even just look at the skies as you contemplate the meaning of life).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Overall, this property is an excellent opportunity to experience easy living at the heart of the Metro.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Is this love at first sight for you?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Find out more when you join us this Saturday from 10am to 4pm to see this lovely home #11 Sundance Street, Greenwoods Executive Village, Pasig City!</p>','{"barangay":"","municiplaity":"Taytay, Rizal","province":"","region":"","street":"Greenwoods Executive Village","village":""}','26000000','0.00','{"option_money_duration":"","payment_mode":"","tax_allocation":"","bank_loan":false,"pagibig_loan":false,"assume_balance":false}','300','329','3','4','2','https://images.philproperties.ph/global_assets/images/properties/99651147037449568421758795807926220646296882009320_160d9f05ce7c0b01aa326130a63520b9.jpg','[]','[]','{"authority_type":"Non-Exclusive Authority To Sell","authority_to_sell_expiration":0,"owned_by":"Rowena Romero Julius Romero","contact_details":"09173015558","exact_address":"10 Hollywood Street Greenwoods, Taytay Rizal"}','-62169956111','1716221478','1','0','0','[]'),
