('2229','107','1','for sale','Residential','0','general brokerage','must-see-classic-5-br-house-in-a-exclusive-neighbor','Must See Classic 5 Br House in a Exclusive Neighbor','["Pre Owned"]','<p>Completely Renovated 5 Bedrooms Spacious House in Prestigious and Upscale Village of Filinvest East Homes.</p><p>Along the wide road in a secured and exclusive FILINVEST EAST in Antipolo City and Cainta.</p><p><br></p><p>Prime Location:</p><p>Located few minutes to Ateneo, UP, <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100005642114830&__cft__[0]=AZX9z7mlQWeFQ2yuBDKlitmwbvtTPsVZxYTTIcpoAKNpfaC1pQkMQ913CfLO9RU42DBPSmUdYaio3WWtLlOA7gCpMenRFr0EbFzwqxs15wVyWnGmY8WxQR_GAa8ZWkVTW8M&__tn__=-]K-R" target="_blank" style="color: var(--accent);">Assumption</a> Antipolo, Ayala Feliz, Sta Lucia Grand Mall,</p><p>and SM Masinag & SM Marikina, Metro Antipolo Hospital, Eastwood offices.</p><p>It is also near Light Rail Transit Stations, Wil-Con Home Depot, Decathlon Store, AMA Computer College, San Benildo School.</p><p><br></p><p>Close to Convenience:</p><p>The Village Gate are McDonalds, Shakeys, Chowking, Dunkin Donuts, HID Burgers..</p><p>East-West Bank, BPI, BDO, 7-11 store, Mercury Drug Store, are within walking distance.</p><p><br></p><p>LA: 277 sqm</p><p>House FA: 372 sqm</p><p><br></p><p>Special Features:</p><p>+ Move-in-Ready</p><p>+Total of landscaped gardens</p><p>+ 2-car garage. May park additional 2 cars in front of the house</p><p>+ The main hardwood door opens to a full living and dining open space.</p><p>+There are 2 doors that lead to the lanai area with a pocket garden.</p><p>+ There is a bedroom with an ensuite bathroom on the ground floor.</p><p>+ The clean kitchen with modern grey cabinets has a clean finish.</p><p>+There is a movable kitchen counter with wheels.</p><p>+ In the Service area there are 2 rooms for maids/driver or storage and a small toilet & shower.</p><p>+ A spacious enclosed service area has 2 long counters for cooking and washing.</p><p><br></p><p>Second Floor</p><p>+ Leads to 4 spacious rooms each with its own modern toilet.</p><p>+Toilet fixtures are all-new with stainless rainforest shower.</p><p>+ There are window screens installed and bay windows for kids rooms.</p><p>+Wardrobe cabinets have sliding doors.</p><p>+ The master bedroom is spaciously located at the far end of the hallway.</p><p>+The ensuite bathroom has a walk-in closet with full mirror sliding doors and space for a vanity counter.</p><p><br></p><p>Reasonably Priced at P21.5 M.</p><p><br></p><p>Must See House.</p><p>For more information or to schedule a private showing of this spacious and family house, please message or call (Globe/Viber) 0917-8307742 and 0917-1198992.</p><p><br></p>','{"barangay":"","municiplaity":"Rizal, Laguna","province":"","region":"","street":"Filinvest East Homes","village":""}','21500000','0.00','{"option_money_duration":"","payment_mode":"","tax_allocation":"","bank_loan":false,"pagibig_loan":false,"assume_balance":false}','372','277','5','5','2','https://images.philproperties.ph/global_assets/images/properties/72423482327819443985220227120302139269599600579756_914a56e74882d0c836bcafaab21a539b.jpg','[]','[]','{"authority_type":"Non-Exclusive Authority To Sell","authority_to_sell_expiration":0,"owned_by":"Caren Marquez","contact_details":"","exact_address":""}','-62169956111','1678682018','4','0','0','[]'),
