rox. distance and travel time):</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(3, 3, 3);">Puregold, Mercedes Ave. Pasig City - 1 km 3 minutes</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(3, 3, 3);">Divimart, Mercedes Ave., Pasig City - 1 km 3 minutes</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(3, 3, 3);">Robinsons Supermarket, Pasig City - 1 km 3 minutes</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(3, 3, 3);">La Consolacion College, Pasig City - 1 km 3 minutes</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(3, 3, 3);">Rustan’s, San Miguel, Pasig City - 2 kms 4 minutes)</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(3, 3, 3);">Sacred Heart Academy of Pasig - 2.3 km 8 minutes</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(3, 3, 3);">Pasig General Hospital, Eusebio St. - 3 kms, 5 minutes</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(3, 3, 3);">Pasig City Hall - 3 km 10 minutes</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(3, 3, 3);">Landers, Arcovia City, Pasig - 6.6 km 16 minutes</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(3, 3, 3);">Tiendesitas, Pasig City - 7 km- 20 minutes</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(3, 3, 3);">Capitol Commons, Kapitoyo Pasig - 7.5 kms 18 minutes</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(3, 3, 3);">Market Market, BGC, Taguig - 7.5 kms 20 minutes</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(3, 3, 3);">Medical City, Ortigas Ave., Pasig - 8 km 20 minutes</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); color: rgb(3, 3, 3);">St. Lukes BGC, Bonifacio Global City- 8 km 30 minutes</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(249, 249