('2510','411','1','for sale','Residential','0','general brokerage','impeccable-relaxing-home-with-a-swimming-pool','Impeccable Relaxing  Home with a Swimming Pool ','["Pre Owned"]','<p>Incredibly , Impeccable Relaxing  3-story home situated in a large lot in a safe and secured neighborhood ..Best value for money .. best location.</p><p>From the open-concept kitchen and living space in a large shaded backyard with a swimming pool surrounded with plants . This peaceful and safe home has plenty of rooms for the whole family from ground floor to the attic so you can explicitly maximize full use situated in an family-friendly neighborhood . From garrage there is a room you can convert into Office home or library</p><p>By now location , best value for money , impeccable home served as the major consideration in owning a property thus, Greenwoods Executive Village is a harmonious and well-maintained community with picnic grounds, basketball court, tennis court, and a multi-purpose clubhouse among others. Its basically a self-contained village , best place to numerous exquisite restaurants offering best dining experience. Its complete with most basic needs like watsons , market place, backyard grown vegetables like lettuce and a lot more. </p><p>Location wise Greenwoods provides convenient accessibility to Cainta, Taytay, and various parts of Metro Manila including Bonifacio Global City and the further south. Should you need to explore malls such as SM Megamall and Shangri-La Plaza or to hospitals like The Medical City and other basic needs such as banks and offices this place is practically awesome. #LuzetteQader</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Property Details</strong></p><p><br></p><p>329 sqm Lot Area</p><p>300 sqm Floor Area</p><p>3 Bedrooms</p><p>4 Toilets & Baths</p><p>2 Garages</p><p>Upgraded Kitchen</p><p>Attic with Comfort Room and 2 Convertible Bedrooms</p><p>Swimming Pool with Hanging Garden</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Price starts at: P18,500,000.00</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Property Description</strong></p><p>The interior of this property offers a spacious living room that creates a meditative atmosphere to enjoy your hobbies and to welcome your distinguished guests. The second floor ensures privacy for everyone in the family with its 3 well-appointed and peaceful bedrooms, each with its own toilet and bath.</p><p>Another interior highlight is that it boasts of a lovely upgraded kitchen with a space to put high-end appliances, perfect for those who are cooks and chefs at heart.</p><p>Need further privacy or another convertible room? This house offers an attic that can be converted into 2 bedrooms and a comfort room, making it a versatile space that can be customized according to your family’s needs. Youll also appreciate the 2 garages, providing ample parking spaces for your vehicles.</p><p>Best place for relaxing and bonding with friends is the swimming pool, paired with a miniature garden that gives a serene and peaceful environment for your family and guests.</p><p>Your home is also equipped with a balcony at the front overlooking the whole street, and a terrace at the back where you can build a hanging garden, host special gatherings, and take photos of the sunrise and sunset.</p><p>In General , this property is a best investment safe, secure and peaceful.</p><p>Discover this best property investment and own this home ..</p>','{"barangay":"","municiplaity":"Pasig City","province":"","region":"","street":"Greenwoods Executive Village","village":""}','18500000','500000.00','{"option_money_duration":"","payment_mode":"","tax_allocation":"","bank_loan":false,"pagibig_loan":false,"assume_balance":false}','300','329','3','4','2','https://images.philproperties.ph/global_assets/images/properties/92728028390380509736171240586590884612559167061226_ca6b6d633f75c022b75ea1656c0b76ed.jpg','[]','[]','{"authority_type":"Non-Exclusive Authority To Sell","authority_to_sell_expiration":0,"owned_by":"","contact_details":"","exact_address":